   "en": "A notorious PD, despised by everyone, becomes an unknown idol in a parallel world.\nOnly his younger sibling remembers him fully.\nTo return to his original world, he must become a top idol and clear the game!\n\n\"...Quest accepted.\"\n\"Are you crazy?\"\n\"Gotta eat to live, don't I?\"\n\nHis specialty is intimidation, his hobby is persuasion.\nThe idol survival story of a ruthless PD who stops at nothing!"
